{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Pogo Jump to the Beat!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Set in a futuristic aerial stadium, stylish and thrilling battles unfold as animal competitors ride pogo sticks. Hop to the rhythm, smash through blocks, and execute daring tricks!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Strategically Corner Your Opponents!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Featuring strategy elements inspired by Go. Instead of placing stones, drop blocks to seize control of the board. Detach blocks to form islands\u2014and claim them as your territory!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">A Wealth of Solo Stages!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Over 30 stages await in Solo Play mode. Use your rhythm and tactical prowess to defeat the rogue systems!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Local 4-Player Matches</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Supports local multiplayer for up to four players.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3672410?t=1745583849","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3672410?t=1745583849","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672410/7cd05c5341d539a5f4d910142ef78b92bf2d09ad/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745583849","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672410/7cd05c5341d539a5f4d910142ef78b92bf2d09ad/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745583849","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen PvP","id":37},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Pogo Jump to the Beat!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Set in a futuristic aerial stadium, stylish and thrilling battles unfold as animal co